{"item":{"cls":"Item","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/epicpaddleadventures\/items\/333279\/","pk":333279,"company":{"cls":"Company","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/epicpaddleadventures\/","pk":74309,"shortname":"epicpaddleadventures","name":"Epic Paddle Adventures","processor_currency":"usd","display_processor_currency":"US dollars"},"name":"Date Night Neon Glow Clear Kayak or Paddleboard \u0026 Champagne Orlando","is_retail":false,"is_archived":false,"is_private":false,"color":9,"unicode":"Date Night Neon Glow Clear Kayak or Paddleboard \u0026 Champagne Orlando","is_bookable_ever_by_phone":false,"sold_out_text":"","cutoff_unreached_kind":"before-start","cutoff_unreached_hours":1.0,"is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book":true,"cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text":"","cutoff_reached_kind":"before-start","cutoff_reached_hours":1.0,"is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book":true,"cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text":"","minimum_initial_party_size":1,"minimum_subsequent_party_size":1,"maximum_initial_party_size":null,"maximum_subsequent_party_size":null,"auto_open_kind":"before-start","auto_open_hours":null,"is_waitlist_when_full":false,"is_unlisted":false,"booking_restriction":null,"is_card_required":false,"is_grouped_calendar":false,"is_free_allowed":true,"is_no_tax":true,"sortable_index":1625,"description":"#Tour Location: 1600 North Orange Avenue, Orlando, FL 32804\n\n#Enjoy a glass of sparkling wine, the setting sun and city lights on this peaceful paddle through Lake Ivanhoe with a Clear Kayak or Paddleboard. This experience just north of downtown Orlando is the best view of the City Beautiful. There are no gators on this lake, so no worries.\n\nLight up the water below with our super bright LED lighting systems. This guided tour is a perfect outside the box adventure. Your guide often plays music from a bluetooth speaker or you can play your own. To top your experience off, complimentary sparkling wine will be served right on the water by your fun guide(s).\n\n#We have super stable vessels. Based on guest feedback, paddle boarding is the favorite option. We also have Clear 2-Person Kayaks and Clear Single Kayaks! \n\t\t\n##Duration\t\t\t\t\t\nPlease allow 2 hours for this experience.\nGuests will be checked in, fitted with vests and paddles, given dry-bags for valuables, pictures, etc. Guests will spend at least 1.5 hours on the water.\n\n##About\n\nLight up the night in style! Choose your favorite color to light up your clear kayak or paddleboard on this unique tour of our gorgeous spring fed lake system. Watch the setting sun at our 730pm session or paddle under the stars at our 930pm session. We'll stop to share some sparkling wine right on the water as we enjoy a leisurely paddle in paradise. It's a picture perfect date night experience.\n\nIf you have been wanting to learn to SUP, this is the perfect experience to try it out. In our professional opinion, it's the best way to experience this tour. Our super stable boards and expert guidance will have you feeling like a pro in no time. You'll have a new skill and insta-worthy pictures to share.\n\nWe'll stay by your side and take lots of pictures. Your photos will be shared with you in an album before you leave.\n\nAfter the paddle session you may want to change clothes to enjoy a refreshing drink or dinner at one of the many restaurants and bars in the Lake Ivanhoe Village. It's a hidden gem in Orlando.\n\nThis is a great way to enjoy nature safely. We may see fish, turtles, birds, and more. WE DO NOT SEE ALLIGATORS on this lake system. \n\n##What's included?\n- Use of paddleboard or kayak and all safety equipment\n- dry bag, sparkling wine\n- complimentary pictures from your guide\t\t\t\t\t\n\n##More info\t\t\t\t\t\n- Alcohol is acceptable to bring with you. Please drink responsibly.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n##What to bring\t\t\t\t\t\n- PLEASE BRING A VALID ID to show you are 21 years or older.\n-Bottled Water\n- Change of clothing in case you want to go to one of the awesome restaurants on shore after your paddle session\n- Towel\n- Drink of choice\n\n*Gratuity for your awesome guide(s)(suggested 20%, had a good time $10 per person, had an amazing time $20 per person)\n\n*Please plan to arrive 30 minutes prior to your tour time in case you run into traffic, use the restroom, etc. Out of respect for our guests, we start our tours on time. If you are not with your guide prior to tour time, you will miss your tour. Have fun on your adventure!","description_text":"","description_bullets":"","seo_description":"","location":"1600 North Orange Avenue, Orlando, FL 32804","booking_notes":"##What to bring\n- Guests can wear a bathing suit or workout attire\n- Bring a towel and change of clothing for after the tour.\n- Our guides work hard to provide an amazing experience for each of our guests. If you enjoy your time with us, please consider a tip. It is so much appreciated!\n\n##Where to meet\nPlease meet your guide at the boat ramp 30 mins prior to tour start time. This will give you time to deal with traffic issues, find parking, use the restroom, and meet your guide(s). Self parking is free along NE Ivanhoe Blvd and Orange Ave, or wherever street parking is available in the area. Out of respect for our guests, we do our best to start our tours at tour time. We can not hold tours for late guests.","cancellation_notes":"","no_transportation_notes":"","no_transportation_minutes":15,"headline":"Beginner friendly! \u2022 We don't see gators here. Ask us why!","short_description":"A romantic neon-lit night paddle with clear kayaks or paddleboards, complimentary champagne, and stunning Orlando city views.","image_url":"","image_cdn_url":"","images":[{"cls":"Image","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/epicpaddleadventures\/items\/333279\/images\/1518543\/","pk":1518543,"unicode":"photo","gallery":"carousel","image_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/LRpu9FH3Tu2ZCUdGCgaK","image_cdn_url":"https:\/\/cdn.filestackcontent.com\/LRpu9FH3Tu2ZCUdGCgaK","company":{"cls":"Company","uri":"\/